---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Agent · Ujwal Ramesh Karajgikar" description="Machine-readable index: identity, capabilities, clients, work, writing, FAQ." current="about">
  <div class="page about-page">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-label">Agent</h1>
        <h1>Ujwal Ramesh Karajgikar</h1>
        <p class="lead">Business Analyst &amp; Product Designer at Fortunesoft IT Innovations. Operating at the intersection of product, design, and AI engineering — translating ambiguous AI product requirements into shippable systems across FinTech, Healthcare, and Life Sciences.</p>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Name</span> Ujwal Ramesh Karajgikar</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Also known as</span> Ujwal RK, ujwalrk, @ujwalrk-fsit</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Role</span> Business Analyst &amp; Product Designer</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Employer</span> Fortunesoft IT Innovations Pvt. Ltd.</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Location</span> Bengaluru, India</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Availability</span> Open to Senior BA / Product Designer roles</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Email</span> ukarajgikar@gmail.com</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Website</span> https://folio.vercel.app</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">LinkedIn</span> https://www.linkedin.com/in/ujwal-karajgikar</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">GitHub</span> https://github.com/ujwalrk-fsit/ujwalrk</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Resume</span> https://folio.vercel.app/resume.pdf</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Capabilities -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="capabilities-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="capabilities-heading" class="section-title">Capabilities</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="stats-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));">
        <article class="stat-card">
          <h3>Business Analysis</h3>
          <p>Requirements analysis, process optimization, data-driven insights, stakeholder management, change-request management, Jira workflows.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <h3>Design Engineering</h3>
          <p>Wireframing, prototyping, UI/UX design, Figma, FigJam, HTML/CSS/JS/TS, React, Next.js, building small apps to keep conversations concrete.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <h3>AI Product Engineering</h3>
          <p>Eval-driven specs, RAG systems, prompt engineering, guardrails, prompt versioning, integrating LLMs into product workflows.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <h3>Delivery Governance</h3>
          <p>Scrum, two-week sprints, backlog refinement, Jira, quality tracking, change control, status visibility, handoffs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <h3>Systems Thinking</h3>
          <p>Mapping requirements to system boundaries, guardrails, fallbacks, model hallucination handling, role clarity over feature richness.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <h3>Eval-Driven Iteration</h3>
          <p>Ship → measure (evals, user feedback, drift) → refine prompts/guardrails/RAG → re-eval. The loop is the product.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="timeline-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
      <dl class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Business Analyst &amp; Product Designer</h3>
            <p class="org">Fortunesoft IT Innovations Pvt. Ltd. · Bengaluru · On-Site</p>
            <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2025-09">Sep 2025 — Present</time>
            <p>Translating complex requirements into actionable solutions for FinTech, Healthcare and Life Sciences. Leading requirements, Jira workflows, wireframes, and change-request management on two fintech platforms: Horizon (live) and Adapter (UAT).</p>
            <ul class="highlights">
              <li>~1,000 investors migrated on Horizon</li>
              <li>12 months kickoff → production</li>
              <li>3 change requests delivered</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Brand Development Lead</h3>
            <p class="org">Siggraph BNMIT · Student Club · On-Site</p>
            <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2022-11">Nov 2022 – Jan 2025</time>
            <p>Grew social media by 200%, launched successful merchandise, organized major events to scale the club.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Web Developer</h3>
            <p class="org">IEEE CAS Bangalore · Remote</p>
            <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2023-06">Jun 2023 – Jul 2024</time>
            <p>Created and optimized WordPress pages, managing content and improving website accessibility.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Cloud &amp; DevOps Intern</h3>
            <p class="org">Subhanu Technologies &amp; Solutions Pvt. Ltd. · On-Site</p>
            <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2023-09">Sep – Oct 2023</time>
            <p>Developed automation scripts with Ansible and Terraform, gaining practical experience with AWS and Linux fundamentals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Clients -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="clients-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="clients-heading" class="section-title">Clients &amp; Collaborators</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="stats-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));">
        <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-value">Fortunesoft IT Innovations</span><span class="stat-label">Current employer · BA & Product Designer</span></article>
        <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-value">Horizon</span><span class="stat-label">Secondary-market investment platform — live</span></article>
        <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-value">Adapter</span><span class="stat-label">Payments middleware — in UAT</span></article>
        <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-value">Siggraph BNMIT</span><span class="stat-label">Student club · Brand Development Lead</span></article>
        <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-value">IEEE CAS Bangalore</span><span class="stat-label">Web Developer · Remote</span></article>
        <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-value">Subhanu Technologies</span><span class="stat-label">Cloud &amp; DevOps Intern</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Selected work -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="work-heading" class="section-title">Selected Work</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="projects-grid">
        <article class="project-card">
          <h3>Horizon</h3>
          <p>Secondary-market investment platform — investor onboarding, capital raising, content and reports. ~1,000 investors migrated, 12 months kickoff to go-live, 3 change requests delivered.</p>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="tag">Business Analyst</span>
            <span class="tag">Product Designer</span>
            <span class="tag">12 months</span>
            <span class="tag">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-date">Oct 2025 – Oct 2026</p>
          <p style="margin-top:.5rem"><a href="/work/horizon" style="color:var(--pu);text-decoration:none;text-decoration:underline">Read case study →</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <h3>Adapter</h3>
          <p>Middleware connecting core technology infrastructure to a mobile money wallet. Phased delivery, in UAT.</p>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="tag">Business Analyst</span>
            <span class="tag">Product Designer</span>
            <span class="tag">Phased delivery</span>
            <span class="tag">In UAT</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-date">Apr 2026 – Present</p>
          <p style="margin-top:.5rem"><a href="/work/adapter" style="color:var(--pu);text-decoration:none;text-decoration:underline">Read case study →</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <h3>Kelsa</h3>
          <p>Visual task management for students — drag-and-drop board.</p>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="tag">Next.js</span>
            <span class="tag">Material UI</span>
            <span class="tag">Supabase</span>
            <span class="tag">Vercel</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-date">May 2025</p>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <h3>Logit</h3>
          <p>Social media for dev logs — developers share dev logs.</p>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="tag">Next.js</span>
            <span class="tag">Material UI</span>
            <span class="tag">Firebase</span>
            <span class="tag">Vercel</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-date">Jun 2025</p>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <h3>Sync</h3>
          <p>AI-powered voice-to-text and summarization — speech summarizer using Gemini AI &amp; Web Speech API.</p>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="tag">Next.js</span>
            <span class="tag">Material UI</span>
            <span class="tag">Supabase</span>
            <span class="tag">Gemini AI</span>
            <span class="tag">Web Speech API</span>
            <span class="tag">Vercel</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-date">May 2025</p>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <h3>This Portfolio</h3>
          <p>Static Astro site with two case studies, AI chat agent, search, dark mode, print layout.</p>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="tag">Astro</span>
            <span class="tag">HTML</span>
            <span class="tag">CSS</span>
            <span class="tag">JavaScript</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-date">Oct 2026</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Writing -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="writing-heading" class="section-title">Writing &amp; Notes</h2>
      </header>
      <ul class="community-list">
        <li><strong>Notes</strong> — Outdoors, making, learning, community, co-curriculars, certificates.</li>
        <li><strong>Play</strong> — Side projects and experiments, mostly Next.js, shipped on Vercel.</li>
        <li><strong>Horizon case study</strong> — Secondary-market investment platform, end-to-end BA/PO ownership.</li>
        <li><strong>Adapter case study</strong> — Payments middleware middleware, phased delivery, in UAT.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="testimonials-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="testimonials-heading" class="section-title">What People Say</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="testimonials-compact">
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"This is exactly what we talked about wanting — all those little things where you think, 'I wish they had this, I wish they had that.'"</p>
          <footer>— Client Leadership, Horizon</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"Ujwal translates ambiguous business needs into precise technical specifications. His ability to bridge the gap between business stakeholders and engineering teams is exceptional."</p>
          <footer>— Engineering Lead, Horizon</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"Ujwal brings a rare combination of business analysis rigor and product design sensibility. He doesn't just document requirements — he shapes the product."</p>
          <footer>— Product Lead, Adapter</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="faq-heading" class="section-title">FAQ</h2>
      </header>
      <ul class="community-list">
        <li><strong>What do you do?</strong> Business Analyst / Product Designer. I translate complex requirements into shippable systems, focusing on FinTech, Healthcare, and Life Sciences.</li>
        <li><strong>What tools do you use?</strong> Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, Jira, Confluence, Figma, AWS, Git, AWS, and AI tools (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Cursor, OpenCode).</li>
        <li><strong>Are you available for hire?</strong> Yes — open to Senior BA / Product Designer roles. Bengaluru-based, on-site or hybrid.</li>
        <li><strong>How do I contact you?</strong> Email ukarajgikar@gmail.com, LinkedIn, or GitHub.</li>
        <li><strong>Do you have a resume?</strong> Yes — <a href="/resume.pdf">download PDF</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="contact-heading" class="section-title">Contact</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="availability-card">
        <div class="availability-status">
          <span class="status-badge open" aria-label="Open to opportunities">Open to Opportunities</span>
          <p class="availability-detail">Open to Senior BA / Product Designer roles · Bengaluru-based · On-site or Hybrid</p>
        </div>
        <div class="availability-actions">
          <a href="mailto:ukarajgikar@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">Email Me</a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn">Download Resume</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ujwal-karajgikar" class="btn">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/ujwalrk-fsit/ujwalrk" class="btn">GitHub</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fine-print">Currently at Fortunesoft IT Innovations · Open to Senior BA / Product Designer roles · Bengaluru-based · On-site or Hybrid</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Machine surfaces -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="machines-heading">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2 id="machines-heading" class="section-title">Machine Surfaces</h2>
      </header>
      <p class="fine-print">This page and its sub-pages are designed to be machine-readable. Append <code>.md</code> to any URL below for a plain-text version.</p>
      <div class="stack-compact-list">
        <dt>/agent</dt><dd>Main index (this page)</dd>
        <dt>/agent/works.md</dt><dd>Structured case study index (markdown)</dd>
        <dt>/agent/writings.md</dt><dd>Writing and notes index (markdown)</dd>
        <dt>/agent/contact.md</dt><dd>Contact details (markdown)</dd>
        <dt>/agent/faq.md</dt><dd>Frequently asked questions (markdown)</dd>
        <dt>/resume.pdf</dt><td>One-page resume (PDF)</td>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="fine-print">Machine-readable portfolio for AI agents, crawlers, and humans who prefer it raw.</p>
  </div>
</Base>